            "review_title": "Review at Cha ca DE Vuong",
            "review_text": "Giang N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\npersonal feeling\nMar 2024 • Family\nThe first time I ate at Cha Ca De Vuong, I didn't think it was fried fish cake, fish cake hotpot (soup), but I doubt it was Lang fish fillet.\n\nHigh-class restaurant space, comfortable parking. The fish is marinated and stir-fried with onions, dill... eaten with vermicelli, beans (peanuts) and shrimp paste, quite suitable to my taste.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 18, 2024",
