            "review_title": "Review at Cha ca DE Vuong",
            "review_text": "Serene\n2 contributions\n0\nNever comeback again!\nJan 2022\nPoor service!\nToday we 4 people had lunch in D3 branch. We ordered a combo no 3 for 4 people plus 2 set because it is only 2 set Cha ca in combo (I showed what i wanna order clearly). But I don't know what they think when they bring us Combo no 4 for 5-6 people plus 2 set Cha ca besides. They also bring us menu with sale off to 99k for a set in Monday and did not mention any thing about they are not run the promotion anymore. They only told me about that until I saw it in the bill (It is still available online as their promotion??? ) While I make a complain they said that I should pay because We are ate the meal. Poor service! Food is not really good as advertising, to much sugary drink and deserts. Bill for 4 people as below. Just warning for anyone wanna try there because I see they run a lot of advertising. For me, will not comeback anymore! 😂😂😂\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 24, 2022",
